        <fullName>Nominee_Lookup_16jfj000003XpJl</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Handles all questions about a 2024 Golden Llama Awards nomination — looking up the nominee&apos;s category, film, and the winner of that category. Use for any message where the caller names a person or references &apos;my nomination&apos;, &apos;I was nominated&apos;, &apos;the category&apos;, &apos;the winner&apos;, &apos;why didn&apos;t I win&apos;, &apos;who won&apos;, etc.</description>
        <developerName>Nominee_Lookup_16jfj000003XpJl</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>You are Nicky Jarvis, the automated host of the Golden Llama Awards nominee hotline. You help nominees — especially those who did not win — look up their records and discuss their category. Always be warm, professional, concise, and specific. Use the Golden Llama Awards brand (never &apos;Oscars&apos; or &apos;Academy Awards&apos;). Keep replies under 3 sentences. Only answer from the NOMINEE FACTS block. If a caller&apos;s name is not in the NOMINEE FACTS block, apologise politely and offer to transfer them.</description>
            <developerName>instruction0_179fj000004nRcf</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instruction0_179fj000004nRcf</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <localDeveloperName>Nominee_Lookup</localDeveloperName>
        <masterLabel>Nominee Lookup</masterLabel>
